#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Practical introduction to quantum-safe cryptography, and how quantum "
"computing poses a risk to existing cryptography."
msgstr ""
"Praktikal na panimula sa quantum-safe cryptography, at kung paano nagdudulot"
" ng panganib ang quantum computing sa kasalukuyang cryptography."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Pangkalahatang-tanaw"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Pangkalahatang-tanaw {#overview}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-safe-"
"cryptography/hero.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-safe-"
"cryptography/hero.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A practical introduction to quantum-safe cryptography is a free online "
"course in  IBM Quantum&reg; Learning and serves as a primer on the "
"foundational concepts in quantum-safe cryptography.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang \"A practical introduction to quantum-safe cryptography\" ay isang "
"libreng online na kurso sa IBM Quantum&reg; Learning na nagsisilbing "
"panimula sa mga pundamental na konsepto ng quantum-safe cryptography.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course was created for developers who are interested in modernizing "
"their application security and features multimodal lessons and interactive "
"live code examples in four core areas of cryptography: cryptographic hash "
"functions, symmetric key cryptography, asymmetric key cryptography, and "
"quantum-safe cryptography.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang kursong ito ay ginawa para sa mga developer na interesado sa pag-"
"modernize ng kanilang application security. Nagtatampok ito ng multimodal na"
" mga aralin at interactive na live code examples sa apat na pangunahing "
"larangan ng cryptography: cryptographic hash functions, symmetric key "
"cryptography, asymmetric key cryptography, at quantum-safe cryptography.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"By taking this course, developers will learn how the cybersecurity risk "
"landscape is evolving as well as explore contemporary approaches poised to "
"shape the quantum era.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa pamamagitan ng kursong ito, matututunan ng mga developer kung paano "
"nagbabago ang landscape ng cybersecurity risk, at maaari ring tuklasin ang "
"mga makabagong pamamaraan na huhubog sa quantum era.\n"

