#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Exam {#exam}"
msgstr "Pagsusulit {#exam}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To earn your Quantum-safe cryptography badge, take the exam at IBM&reg; "
"Training. This exam is intended to be taken after reading the lessons in "
"this course. After you pass the exam, you will be notified by Credly that "
"you have earned a badge.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para makuha ang iyong Quantum-safe cryptography badge, kunin ang pagsusulit "
"sa IBM&reg; Training. Ang pagsusulit na ito ay inilaan na gawin pagkatapos "
"basahin ang mga aralin sa kursong ito. Kapag naipasa mo na ang pagsusulit, "
"aabisuhan ka ng Credly na nakamit mo na ang isang badge.\n"

